   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: finding; f1040sd line 5, \"Net short-term gain or (loss) from partnerships, S corporations, estates, and trusts from Schedule(s) K-1\". The value is right: a Schedule K-1 is asked of everyone by scope.k1, which refuses Form 1040 line 8 through scope.schedule1, so no completed return has a K-1 capital gain and line 5 is $0 on every computed return. The reply is right that sd.other_forms tests no K-1 case: its label still says \"or capital gains or losses on a Schedule K-1\", stale since the redraft moved the K-1 words to scope.k1 (MAP 2.7), so the refusal the line shows names a test that does not exist. Low (BUG-0638).",
   "subject_key": "198f10ce4af6b0dd2c5300d31dff105bff140abaae4a6fac95af2c47df83af4c"
